As part of a #NationalIntegrationTour under #OpSadbhavana, 14 students and two teachers from PM SHRI Mangan Senior Secondary School, North #Sikkim visited the #ArmyAirDefence Centre at #Gopalpur.

The young visitors explored the rich history and proud legacy of the Corps at the Army Air Defence Museum, witnessed key training facilities and experienced simulated combat weapon engagement through the Combat Weapon Training Simulator.

Beyond an exposure to military life, the visit offered the students a glimpse into the discipline, technology and dedication that underpin service to the Nation, strengthening their sense of connection with the #IndianArmy and the spirit of national integration.

